# IlyWear E-Commerce Project Walkthrough

The IlyWear Next.js e-commerce application has been successfully built according to the requirements.

## What was built

We have manually set up a robust Next.js 14 App Router application with Tailwind CSS, TypeScript, and ESLint, focusing on performance, modern UI, and mobile-first design. 

The application architecture includes:

1. **Brand Aesthetics**: The required styling (Black, White, Accent Gold/Beige) was implemented natively alongside modern spacing and typography standards. Custom animations (`animate-slide-down`, `animate-fade-in`) were added to the Tailwind config.
2. **Global Components**: 
   - [Header.tsx](file:///c:/Users/hp/Desktop/IlyWear/src/components/Header.tsx): A sticky navigation bar with a responsive mobile menu and integrated search.
   - [Footer.tsx](file:///c:/Users/hp/Desktop/IlyWear/src/components/Footer.tsx): A comprehensive footer with social links, categorized sitemap, and quick contact details.
   - [ProductCard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/hp/Desktop/IlyWear/src/components/ProductCard.tsx): Reusable cards displaying product images, prices in MAD, categories, and direct integration with the "Order on WhatsApp" functionality.
   - [SkeletonCard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/hp/Desktop/IlyWear/src/components/SkeletonCard.tsx): Visual loading placeholders for when product API data is fetching.
   - [SearchBar.tsx](file:///c:/Users/hp/Desktop/IlyWear/src/components/SearchBar.tsx): Client-side interactivity for searching products directly.
3. **API Integration ([src/services/products.ts](file:///c:/Users/hp/Desktop/IlyWear/src/services/products.ts))**: Designed to securely pass the affiliate API key `BOUT_qSnliOWKqflJWvzMQSrItXMxT3oeBkmv`. In the absence of a real endpoint, the service elegantly falls back to mapped mock data with Moroccan Dirham (MAD) pricing and men/women categorizations, ready to be hot-swapped with the real endpoint URL.
4. **App Pages**:
   - [app/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/hp/Desktop/IlyWear/src/app/page.tsx): The home page featuring a massive Hero Banner, Categories sections (Men/Women), Featured Products grid, and a Promotions CTA.
   - [app/shop/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/hp/Desktop/IlyWear/src/app/shop/page.tsx): Dynamic product grid with filtering capabilities based on URL parameters (`?category=women`, `?q=shoes`). Validates and queries the service on the server-side, returning SEO-friendly SSR pages.
   - `app/product/[id]/page.tsx`: A gorgeous detail page providing a larger product view, enriched descriptions, and the direct WhatsApp ordering mechanism.

