## WhatsApp Integration Validation

When a user clicks "Order on WhatsApp", the link is formulated effectively:
`https://wa.me/212600000000?text=Hello%20I%20want%20to%20order...`
This automatically opens WhatsApp with the dynamically parsed message containing the Product Name, Price, and ID, bypassing traditional cart checkout seamlessly as requested.

## Next Steps for the User

1. Navigate to your project folder: `cd Desktop/IlyWear`
2. Run the development server: `npm run dev`
3. View the fully responsive, fully animated application in your browser at `http://localhost:3000`.
